$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Unknown" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> spot one another while doing a recon on the frontier.  Now they have intercepted each other and in the middle of the battlefield there is an abandoned tower that each tribe is planning on using as defense.  Grab the tower and attack the enemy's base to win.		---XGN cLiPPy ";